    "type": "game",
    "name": "Executioner",
    "steam_appid": 3324420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the executioner of the prison, and your task is to execute all the death row prisoners. Prisoners will rush out from the various gates of the prison. In order to survive and not be killed by you, they will run towards you at the fastest speed and try to kill you. You must find a way to kill all these prisoners. Each time you kill a prisoner, you will get a corresponding monetary reward. You can use this money to buy weapons with greater firepower and lethality to face the charge of wave after wave of death row prisoners.\u00a0All you can do is fight hard and stay alive as long as possible until you finally face your inevitable death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.poster.avif?t=1755183211\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.webm?t=1755183211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.mp4?t=1755183211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoners' movement and running speed will be faster than the previous round of battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four maps in the game. Different maps will have different weapons and weapons with selected accessories, and the prices will also be different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are stored in green boxes under the high walls around the prison, and you can buy them as needed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, you only have a pistol and a knife, and you need to kill more enemies to buy expensive weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30 weapons for you to choose from in the game (pistols, submachine guns, sniper rifles, shotguns, light machine guns, grenades).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy wave will last for 1 minute, and you must do everything you can to kill more enemies and survive during this time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are almost no obstacles in the game, and you need to keep moving and positioning to avoid enemies coming from behind the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can press the P key on the keyboard to switch between first-person and third-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can only buy one grenade at a time and can only buy it again after using it. You need to use running and moving as much as possible to gather the prisoners together and then blow them up.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can play online cooperatively at the same time.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the executioner of the prison, and your task is to execute all the death row prisoners. Prisoners will rush out from the various gates of the prison. In order to survive and not be killed by you, they will run towards you at the fastest speed and try to kill you. You must find a way to kill all these prisoners. Each time you kill a prisoner, you will get a corresponding monetary reward. You can use this money to buy weapons with greater firepower and lethality to face the charge of wave after wave of death row prisoners.\u00a0All you can do is fight hard and stay alive as long as possible until you finally face your inevitable death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.poster.avif?t=1755183211\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.webm?t=1755183211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324420/extras/e3e1ac457ca75dee47b818aa01c34fbb.mp4?t=1755183211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoners' movement and running speed will be faster than the previous round of battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four maps in the game. Different maps will have different weapons and weapons with selected accessories, and the prices will also be different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are stored in green boxes under the high walls around the prison, and you can buy them as needed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, you only have a pistol and a knife, and you need to kill more enemies to buy expensive weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30 weapons for you to choose from in the game (pistols, submachine guns, sniper rifles, shotguns, light machine guns, grenades).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy wave will last for 1 minute, and you must do everything you can to kill more enemies and survive during this time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are almost no obstacles in the game, and you need to keep moving and positioning to avoid enemies coming from behind the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can press the P key on the keyboard to switch between first-person and third-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can only buy one grenade at a time and can only buy it again after using it. You need to use running and moving as much as possible to gather the prisoners together and then blow them up.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can play online cooperatively at the same time.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Executioner is a 1-4 player online coop shooting survival game. There are a large number of extremely heinous criminals waiting to be executed in the overcrowded prison. In order to survive, they will rush towards you and try to kill you. If you don't kill them, you will be the one killed.",
